{"id":"18e8ff49-ec08-4a12-8e9d-80e0b59f4296","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:08:37.140Z","batchId":"profile_qwen3-8-flash-gateway_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"profile","prompt":"A user profile card with avatar, name, role, short bio, a few stats and a follow button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .cover { height:140px; border-radius:12px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2f6df6,#7b3ff2 55%,#e0507a); position:relative; }\n  .profile-head { display:flex; align-items:flex-end; gap:1.25rem; margin-top:-52px; padding:0 1.25rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }\n  .avatar-lg { width:104px; height:104px; border-radius:50%; font-size:2rem; border:4px solid var(--bg-surface, #fff); background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2f6df6,#7b3ff2); color:#fff; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:700; flex:0 0 auto; }\n  .skill { white-space:nowrap; }\n  @media (max-width:620px){ .profile-head{ margin-top:-40px; } .avatar-lg{ width:80px; height:80px; font-size:1.6rem; } }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h1>Profile</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead muted\">Public view of your account — what other members see when they open your page.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" id=\"share-btn\">Share profile</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Edit profile</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" style=\"padding-bottom:1.5rem;\">\n    <div class=\"cover\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"profile-head\">\n      <div class=\"avatar avatar-lg\">AO</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"flex:1; min-width:220px;\">\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:baseline;\">\n          <h2 style=\"margin:0;\">Amara Osei</h2>\n          <span class=\"badge\">✓ Verified</span>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">PRO</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0;\">Staff Frontend Engineer · Lumino Studio</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Lisbon, Portugal · Joined March 2019 · @amara.osei</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:flex-end; margin-left:auto;\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" aria-label=\"More options\">⋯</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-lg\" id=\"follow-btn\" data-following=\"false\">Follow</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p style=\"max-width:62ch; margin:0;\">\n      I build design systems and accessible interfaces for data-heavy products. Eight years shipping production\n      frontends, currently leading the component library behind Lumino's analytics suite. I write weekly about\n      performance budgets, component APIs, and the unglamorous parts of CSS. Mentoring junior engineers through\n      the OpenCraft program.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline skill\">TypeScript</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline skill\">React</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline skill\">Design Systems</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline skill\">Accessibility</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline skill\">Performance</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline skill\">WebGL</span>\n      <a class=\"skill\" href=\"#\" style=\"color:inherit; text-decoration:underline;\">amaraosei.dev</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-4 gap-lg\" id=\"stats\">\n      <div class=\"stack\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Followers</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"followers\">12,480</span>\n        <span class=\"small up\">▲ 214 this week</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Following</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">286</span>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">across 34 teams</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Posts</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">1,204</span>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">last post 2 days ago</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Reactions earned</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">48.6k</span>\n        <span class=\"small up\">▲ 6.2% vs last month</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <div>\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">Activity — last 12 weeks</h3>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Posts, comments and merged pull requests.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Weekly activity\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"W2\",\"value\":24},{\"label\":\"W3\",\"value\":15},{\"label\":\"W4\",\"value\":31},{\"label\":\"W5\",\"value\":27},{\"label\":\"W6\",\"value\":42},{\"label\":\"W7\",\"value\":36},{\"label\":\"W8\",\"value\":22},{\"label\":\"W9\",\"value\":48},{\"label\":\"W10\",\"value\":39},{\"label\":\"W11\",\"value\":51},{\"label\":\"W12\",\"value\":44}]}'></div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Peak in week 9 — design-system v3 release notes thread.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <div>\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">Languages in shipped work</h3>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Share of merged lines across public repositories.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"pie\",\"title\":\"Languages\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"TypeScript\",\"value\":54},{\"label\":\"CSS / Sass\",\"value\":19},{\"label\":\"Python\",\"value\":12},{\"label\":\"Go\",\"value\":9},{\"label\":\"Rust\",\"value\":6}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack\">\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <div>\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">Recent projects</h3>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Pinned repositories, most recently updated first.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">View all 38</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>Project</th><th>Status</th><th>Stars</th><th>Contributors</th><th>Updated</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong>lumen-ds</strong><br><span class=\"muted small\">Accessible React component library</span></td>\n          <td><span class=\"badge\">Active</span></td>\n          <td class=\"num\">3,204</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">27</td>\n          <td>2 days ago</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong>budgetwatch</strong><br><span class=\"muted small\">CI bot that fails builds on bundle-size regressions</span></td>\n          <td><span class=\"badge\">Active</span></td>\n          <td class=\"num\">1,158</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">9</td>\n          <td>1 week ago</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong>tokens-sync</strong><br><span class=\"muted small\">Design-token pipeline for Figma → code</span></td>\n          <td><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Beta</span></td>\n          <td class=\"num\">642</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">4</td>\n          <td>3 weeks ago</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong>canvas-metrics</strong><br><span class=\"muted small\">WebGL dashboard experiments</span></td>\n          <td><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Archived</span></td>\n          <td class=\"num\">187</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">2</td>\n          <td>8 months ago</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n    <div>\n      <h3 class=\"card-title\">Profile strength</h3>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Completing your profile lifts discoverability in the directory by roughly 3×.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack\">\n      <div class=\"between small\"><span>Bio &amp; headline</span><span class=\"muted\">Done</span></div>\n      <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:100%\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack\">\n      <div class=\"between small\"><span>Links &amp; skills</span><span class=\"muted\">6 of 8 filled</span></div>\n      <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:75%\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack\">\n      <div class=\"between small\"><span>Verification documents</span><span class=\"muted\">2 of 3 uploaded</span></div>\n      <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:60%\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"alert\">\n      <div>\n        <strong>Add a pronoun field and a second project link</strong>\n        <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:.25rem 0 0;\">One step from a complete profile. Takes under two minutes.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Finish setup</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    var btn = document.getElementById('follow-btn');\n    var countEl = document.getElementById('followers');\n    var count = 12480;\n    var stats = document.querySelectorAll('#stats .stat-label');\n    var followersCell = stats[0] && stats[0].nextElementSibling;\n    var followingCell = stats[1] && stats[1].nextElementSibling;\n    var baseFollowing = parseInt(followingCell.textContent.replace(/,/g, ''), 10) || 286;\n\n    function render() {\n      var on = btn.getAttribute('data-following') === 'true';\n      countEl.textContent = count.toLocaleString('en-US');\n      if (followersCell) followersCell.textContent = count.toLocaleString('en-US');\n      if (followingCell) followingCell.textContent = (baseFollowing + (on ? 1 : 0)).toLocaleString('en-US');\n      btn.textContent = on ? 'Following' : 'Follow';\n      btn.classList.toggle('btn-secondary', on);\n      btn.classList.toggle('btn-lg', true);\n    }\n\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var on = btn.getAttribute('data-following') === 'true';\n      btn.setAttribute('data-following', on ? 'false' : 'true');\n      count += on ? -1 : 1;\n      btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(!on));\n      render();\n    });\n    btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');\n\n    var share = document.getElementById('share-btn');\n    var original = share.textContent;\n    share.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      share.textContent = 'Link copied ✓';\n      share.setAttribute('data-following', 'x');\n      setTimeout(function () { share.textContent = original; }, 1600);\n    });\n\n    render();\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[13031,"<style>\n "],[13031," ."],[13141,"cover { height:"],[13151,"1"],[13151,"40px;"],[13151," border"],[13229,"-radius:12"],[13282,"px; background:"],[13322,"linear-gradient(1"],[13447,"35deg,#"],[13457,"2f6df"],[13467,"6,#7b"],[13688,"3ff2 "],[13698,"55%,"],[13698,"#e05"],[13781,"07a);"],[13871," position"],[13879,":relative; }\n"],[14001,"  ."],[14045,"profile-head { display"],[14055,":flex;"],[14096," align-items:flex-end"],[14103,"; gap:1"],[14312,".25rem"],[14320,"; margin-top"],[14353,":-52px"],[14363,"; padding"],[14363,":0 1"],[14483,".25rem"],[14493,"; flex"],[14493,"-wrap:wrap;"],[14609," }\n  ."],[14695,"avatar-lg { width"],[14703,":1"],[14703,"04px;"],[14703," height:1"],[14827,"04px;"],[14837," border-radius:"],[14871,"50%; font"],[14886,"-size:2rem"],[15047,"; border:4"],[15177,"px solid var(--"],[15187,"bg"],[15187,"-surface, #"],[15187,"fff);"],[15350," background:linear-gradient"],[15360,"(13"],[15360,"5deg